### Decision

**No, not initially.** Refs are a "look up" thing โ€” visible on `show`, followed as links. Filtering by ref is a niche search use case. Keep it simple: refs are set on create/update, displayed on show, no filtering on list/ready/blocked. Add later if demand emerges.

