␀ห?ศ␀␀␀␀␀หฟ…ศ␀␀␀␀␀ห?๘␀␀␀␀␀ห?D␀␀␀␀␀ห?”␀␀␀␀␀ห?ค␀␀␀␀␀หฟ•0␀␀␀␀␀ข47ขidู0cli-enhancements-discussion-cli-enhancements-011งcontentฺบ## What new fields show in list output vs show output?

### Decision

**List output adds type only.** List becomes: ID, Status, Priority, Type, Title. Type is a single short word, high signal for scanning. Tags and refs are variable-length and would clutter the table โ€” they belong in `show` detail only. When type is not set, display a dash (`-`) to keep alignment clean.

**Show output adds all new fields:** type, tags, refs, notes.

