> **Corrigendum 2026-09-20** (from `free-text-round-trip`): "Long text fields get their own unstructured sections" (TOON output principle 3), and the worked `tick show` example that printed the description as an indented raw block โ€” corrected: a long text field is a single TOON-quoted value on the section it belongs to, so the example now reads `description: "Full task description here.\nCan be multiple lines."`. The unstructured section is the form that made tick's toon output unparseable: it is hand-assembled rather than produced by the encoder, and it obliges a reader to know an indentation-stripping rule the document never states. The quoted value is what the library emits from a Go string, and it is the rule note text already obeyed, so all free text in the output now decodes the same way. The `task{โ€ฆ}` and `stats{โ€ฆ}` scope headers in the same passage are left standing: they are superseded by `free-text-round-trip` ยง5 rather than corrected here.ฉwork_unitขv1ฉwork_typeคepicฅphaseญspecificationฅtopicฉtick-coreชconfidenceคhighซsource_fileู6.workflows/v1/specification/tick-core/specification.mdฉtimestampหBzýVHญ•ฉembeddingÜ␀หฟ~0␀␀␀␀␀ห?๘␀␀␀␀␀ห?|␀␀␀␀␀ห?<␀␀␀␀␀ห?␀␀␀␀␀␀ห?␀␀␀␀␀หฟข\␀␀␀␀␀ห?7d␀␀␀␀␀หฟe␀␀␀␀␀ห?]ü␀␀␀␀␀ห?กะ␀␀␀␀␀ห?ิ␀␀␀␀␀หฟ␀␀␀␀␀ห?r␀␀␀␀␀ห?ฉ␀␀␀␀␀ห?–H␀␀␀␀␀หฟ”␀␀␀␀␀หฟH␀␀␀␀␀ห?[ภ␀␀␀␀␀ห?จ(␀␀␀␀␀ห?’␀␀␀␀␀␀หฟ–$␀␀␀␀␀ห?ฃ8␀␀␀␀␀ห?๘␀␀␀␀␀หฟฃt␀␀␀␀␀หฟ’P␀␀␀␀␀หฟ`␀␀␀␀␀ห?ขฤ␀␀␀␀␀ห?␀␀␀␀␀หฟ~่␀␀␀␀␀หฟ—ฬ␀␀␀␀␀หฟค␀␀␀␀␀ห?rจ␀␀␀␀␀หฟv่␀␀␀␀␀หฟ์␀␀␀␀␀ห?P␀␀␀␀␀ห?เ␀␀␀␀␀ห?␀␀␀␀␀ห?ข0␀␀␀␀␀หฟฃ␀␀␀␀␀หฟ{␀␀␀␀␀หฟฌ␀␀␀␀␀หฟg`␀␀␀␀␀หฟ$␀␀␀␀␀ห?␀␀␀␀␀␀ห? ␀␀␀␀␀หฟก`␀␀␀␀␀ห?␀␀␀␀␀ห?t␀␀␀␀␀ห?๘␀␀␀␀␀ห?—ค␀␀␀␀␀ห?v␀␀␀␀␀ห?ิ␀␀␀␀␀หฟฃ␀␀␀␀␀หฟ€␀␀␀␀␀หฟภ␀␀␀␀␀หฟิ␀␀␀␀␀ห?”@␀␀␀␀␀ห?ช์␀␀␀␀␀หฟฃ␀␀␀␀␀ห?•␀␀␀␀␀หฟิ␀␀␀␀␀ห?␀␀␀␀␀หฟv␀␀␀␀␀หฟฏD␀␀␀␀␀ห?งฌ␀␀␀␀␀หฟข0␀␀␀␀␀หฟ]␀␀␀␀␀ห?`8␀␀␀␀␀หฟิ␀␀␀␀␀ห?ฉ␀␀␀␀␀ห?–0␀␀␀␀␀หฟ‘ฤ␀␀␀␀␀หฟ␀␀␀␀␀หฟe␀␀␀␀␀หฟดL␀␀␀␀␀ห?ศ␀␀␀␀␀ห? ␀␀␀␀␀ห?b”␀␀␀␀␀ห?q”␀␀␀␀␀หฟ\␀␀␀␀␀ห?D␀␀␀␀␀หฟฅฌ␀␀␀␀␀หฟฆ ␀␀␀␀␀ห?จ␀␀␀␀␀หฟ€␀␀␀␀␀หฟ␀␀␀␀␀หฟF0␀␀␀␀␀หฟ␀␀␀␀␀หฟภ␀␀␀␀␀หฟ x␀␀␀␀␀หฟrX␀␀␀␀␀ห?L␀␀␀␀␀หฟP,␀␀␀␀␀ห?