**User's fix lean (symptom gathering, 2026-09-21) โ€” resolved.** The lean was to raise timestamp precision so the sort no longer ties. It was taken seriously: adopted as the direction at one point, then ruled out by measurement (100 in-process stamps share one millisecond; already-stored tasks never gain precision). The reporter's own reframing replaced it โ€” a timestamp is an observation, not a statement of sequence โ€” which produced the chosen direction. Full journey in Fix Direction โ’ Discussion.

**Scope note on the chosen direction.** Blocker-list ordering (resolution 5) is the one place the fix reaches past the reported symptom: it requires the `blocked_by` array's order to be carried into the cache so `tick show` stops disagreeing with `tick dep tree` and with the stored record. Flagged here because a specification could reasonably split it out.ฉwork_unitผsame-second-tasks-sort-by-idฉwork_typeฆbugfixฅphaseญinvestigationฅtopicผsame-second-tasks-sort-by-idชconfidenceฆmediumซsource_fileูU.workflows/same-second-tasks-sort-by-id/investigation/same-second-tasks-sort-by-id.mdฉtimestampหBzC๑มฉembeddingÜ␀หฟ๘␀␀␀␀␀ห?␀␀␀␀␀ห?ิ␀␀␀␀␀ห?h␀␀␀␀␀หฟ``␀␀␀␀␀ห? ภ␀␀␀␀␀หฟข␀␀␀␀␀หฟฆ`␀␀␀␀␀หฟขศ␀␀␀␀␀ห?–<␀␀␀␀␀ห?ฉ€␀␀␀␀␀ห?ข␀␀␀␀␀หฟ– ␀␀␀␀␀หฟกp␀␀␀␀␀ห?ภ␀␀␀␀␀ห?่␀␀␀␀␀ห?␀␀␀␀␀หฟ␀␀␀␀␀หฟฅฬ␀␀␀␀␀ห?␀␀␀␀␀ห?จ๐␀␀␀␀␀หฟ(␀␀␀␀␀ห?ฑศ␀␀␀␀␀ห?$␀␀␀␀␀ห?qุ␀␀␀␀␀หฟL␀␀␀␀␀ห?W๔␀␀␀␀␀ห?ค␀␀␀␀␀ห?ฃค␀␀␀␀␀หฟ“4␀␀␀␀␀ห?’X␀␀␀␀␀หฟผ␀␀␀␀␀ห?๘␀␀␀␀␀หฟ|␀␀␀␀␀หฟ–␀␀␀␀␀หฟsü␀␀␀␀␀ห?–0␀␀␀␀␀หฟ~”␀␀␀␀␀ห?{L␀␀␀␀␀หฟ$␀␀␀␀␀หฟจü␀␀␀␀␀หฟฅ,␀␀␀␀␀หฟท”␀␀␀␀␀ห?S<␀␀␀␀␀ห?x$␀␀␀␀␀หฟp␀␀␀␀␀ห?`␀␀␀␀␀ห?␀␀␀␀␀หฟ@␀␀␀␀␀หฟqิ␀␀␀␀␀ห?gจ␀␀␀␀␀ห?c␀␀␀␀␀ห?Y่␀␀␀␀␀ห?y␀␀␀␀␀หฟ\␀␀␀␀␀หฟธ␀␀␀␀␀ห?a␀␀␀␀␀หฟ๔␀␀␀␀␀ห?ะ␀␀␀␀␀ห?“0␀␀␀␀␀ห?ฉ๐␀␀␀␀␀หฟ\␀␀␀␀␀ห?D␀␀␀␀␀หฟง<␀␀␀␀␀ห?W␀␀␀␀␀ห?เ␀␀␀␀␀หฟช␀␀␀␀␀ห?ก␀␀␀␀␀ห?•ผ␀␀␀␀␀หฟ•d␀␀␀␀␀ห?␀␀␀␀␀ห?ฅ@␀␀␀␀␀หฟ~␀␀␀␀␀␀ห?pd␀␀␀␀␀ห?”จ␀␀␀␀␀หฟฆL␀␀␀␀␀ห?ฆH␀␀␀␀␀ห?ผ␀␀␀␀␀ห?0␀␀␀␀␀ห?␀␀␀␀␀หฟ…์␀␀␀␀␀หฟh(␀␀␀␀␀หฟข@␀␀␀␀␀หฟข4␀␀␀␀␀ห?D␀␀␀␀␀หฟ–์␀␀␀␀␀ห?\t␀␀␀␀␀หฟิ␀␀␀␀␀หฟุ␀␀␀␀␀หฟ<␀␀␀␀␀หฟyÜ␀␀␀␀␀ห?x␀␀␀␀␀ห?mุ␀␀␀␀␀ห?␀␀␀␀␀ห?D␀␀␀␀␀หฟฎ␀␀␀␀␀หฟข<␀␀␀␀␀ห? <␀␀␀␀␀หฟ␀␀␀␀␀ห?b`␀␀␀␀␀ห?ขX␀␀␀␀␀หฟ เ␀␀␀␀␀หฟ0␀␀␀␀␀หฟธT␀␀␀␀␀ห?ฑด␀␀␀␀␀ห?d␀␀␀␀␀ห?ฌ␀␀␀␀␀ห?p␀␀␀␀␀หฟฅ๘␀␀␀␀␀หฟข$␀␀␀␀␀หฟชผ␀␀␀␀␀ห?n@␀␀␀␀␀หฟงl␀␀␀␀␀ห?ข␀␀␀␀␀หฟ—␀␀␀␀␀หฟฃü␀␀␀␀␀หฟขl␀␀␀␀␀ห?”␀␀␀␀␀หฟ’ะ␀␀␀␀␀ห?{ธ␀␀␀␀␀หฟ—␀␀␀␀␀หฟ”์␀␀␀␀␀หฟไ␀␀␀␀␀หฟH␀␀␀␀␀หฟ~ ␀␀␀␀␀หฟ␀␀␀␀␀ห?งฌ␀␀␀␀␀หฟฐ␀␀␀␀␀หฟ—Ü␀␀␀␀␀ห?`␀␀␀␀␀ห?กฤ␀␀␀␀␀ห?ฅd␀␀␀␀␀ห?•␀␀␀␀␀ห?Hผ␀␀␀␀␀หฟค4␀␀␀␀␀หฟด␀␀␀␀␀หฟ•ฌ␀␀␀␀␀ห?p␀␀␀␀␀หฟขx␀␀␀␀␀ห?r␀␀␀␀␀หฟญ ␀␀␀␀␀ห?’๐␀␀␀␀␀ห?จ␀␀␀␀␀หฟ—L␀␀␀␀␀หฟ|␀␀␀␀␀ห?“\␀␀␀␀␀หฟ”d␀␀␀␀␀ห?ฆH␀␀␀␀␀ห?•d␀␀␀␀␀หฟe่␀␀␀␀␀หฟ’ิ␀␀␀␀␀ห?กL␀␀␀␀␀หฟภ␀␀␀␀␀ห?4␀